    <item>
      <title>超越计算：GPT-5 Pro数学“登顶”背后的AI理解力边界与人类认知重构</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/gpt-5-proai-20251013084005073-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 08:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
